/// [Money] A recurring commitment that leaves an account on a fixed day: loan EMI, school fee, card payment, SIP, premium. Obligations are committed cash: they reduce what can safely be moved or invested. Contoso extension entity: no CDM profile entity, BIAN status unmapped. Star role: fact; grain: one scheduled obligation. Lakehouse: fact_scheduled_obligation <- silver_scheduled_obligation <- scheduled-obligations.json.
